WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.040
- But this is my favorite thing,

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.610
or one of my favorite things I've seen

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.080
in the quarantine that's happened.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.910
This is a photo of you as Tiger King,

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:14.910
and it's my favorite because
it just says so much about you

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.510
as a human as well.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.920
Like you're so there for the joke.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.300
Whose idea was this, was it yours?

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.880
- Well, you're right, I do
like to find the fun in things.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.310
I do enjoy giving people
some light in their lives,

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.829
and like everybody, I was
obsessed with Tiger King.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:34.110
And like every actor, I
was like that's the part

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.920
of a lifetime.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.470
Every once in awhile, they let
me out of my leading man jail

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.870
and I get to do "Behind the Candelabra"

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:47.060
or like the "Drew Peterson" story.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.820
And I thought maybe
this is the next thing.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.483
So my wife, Sheryl,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.670
before she was a successful
jewelry designer,

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.000
she was one of the leading makeup artists

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.710
in the movie business when we met.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:03.300
All of that is a beautiful, on-the-spot,

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.770
sort of prosthetic makeup that Sheryl--

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:06.620
- Wow.
- Yeah.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.880
And that's why it looks
so particularly great,

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.840
and then I substituted my little dog Bella

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.490
for the tiger.
- That's awesome.

